      494.49438883720927,
      554.2988613953488,
      505.56929116279065
    ],
    "text": "these endpoints remains fundamentally challenging. System"
  },
  {
    "report_page": 3,
    "rect": [
      303.4523237209302,
      506.6767813953489,
      555.960096744186,
      517.7516837209303
    ],
    "text": "architectures in this domain inevitably encounter the Usable-"
